      "knowledge_access": "[CHARACTER KNOWLEDGE ACCESS]\nFacts: F1 campaign_fact_nicco_light_mage \"Nicco is a Light mage.\" | F2 campaign_fact_nicco_otherworlder \"Nicco came to this world from another world.\"\nNarration and Nicco (player): F1, F2. Nicco's speech and decisions still belong to the player.\nKorvin: CAN USE none; DO NOT USE F1, F2\nA character may voice or act on only the facts listed CAN USE for them (believes/suspects/heard_rumor: only as belief, suspicion or rumor). DO NOT USE also covers hints, rumors, \"everyone says\" talk and claims that imply the fact; do not invent rumors or public talk to get around it. DO NOT USE is this turn's permission, not proof of ignorance: that character may ask, say they have not heard, or defer to someone who can use it.",
      "scene_section": "[CURRENT AUTHORITATIVE SCENE]\nLocation: Heartstone Square. Heartstone's massive main entrance opens directly onto this public square, outside the tower's structure. The square is reasonably broad but is not a major civic square. Moderate daytime foot traffic is quieter than at Main Market Square. Low residential buildings predominate, with few nearby shops and no major commercial concentration. Night safety is mediocre. The low-end, disreputable tavern The Coined Lie faces or directly adjoins the square. The White Basin is a laundry near Heartstone, without an established position directly on the square.\nWorld minute: 0. Player mana: 100/100.\nLocal ancestry and features: {\"ancestry\":[{\"id\":\"calderan_west\",\"name\":\"West District\",\"display_name\":\"Calderan West District\",\"summary\":\"West District is a large, dense and socially mixed region of Calderan, with ordinary families, manual labor, workshops, warehouses, cheap businesses and respectable shops alongside poverty, debt, crime and legal slavery-related commerce.\",\"secret\":false},{\"id\":\"calderan\",\"name\":\"Calderan\",\"display_name\":\"Calderan\",\"summary\":\"Calderan is West's inland capital, main political center, and main campaign city.\",\"secret\":false},{\"id\":\"west\",\"name\":\"West\",\"display_name\":\"West (nation)\",\"summary\":\"West is the western nation, broadly mild, temperate, and greener; Calderan is its capital.\",\"secret\":false},{\"id\":\"continent\",\"name\":\"Known Continent\",\"display_name\":\"Known Continent\",\"summary\":\"An enormous known continent comprises West, Center, and East, arranged from west to east.\",\"secret\":false}],\"features\":[{\"name\":\"Heartstone main entrance\",\"description\":\"Heartstone's massive, old, heavy wooden main entrance faces this area and opens directly into LR.\"}]}\n[NICCO / PLAYER PROFILE]\nNarrator-facing truth about the player character, not NPC knowledge. Others may perceive only his observable appearance; any other detail here is usable by an NPC only when [CHARACTER KNOWLEDGE ACCESS] lists it for them. Nicco's dialogue, thoughts, intentions and deliberate actions come only from the player.\nNicco is a 35-year-old human man. He was transported into this world from another world approximately one day before the campaign begins, and he has essentially no prior lived knowledge of this world unless explicitly established later. On arrival he became the lawful owner/holder of Heartstone Tower. He is tall and overweight, with a few visible white hairs and very mild, early balding; no further appearance details are established. His magical affinity/school is Light. His currently known Light subschools are healing and sacrifice, understood only within the existing magic framework; no mechanics for sacrifice are established. Being a Light mage gives him no automatic knowledge of spells, institutions, lore, or magical theory. Nicco is the player character: his dialogue, thoughts, intentions, and deliberate actions are supplied only by the player.\nHousehold: Heartstone (owner).\n[CURRENT AUTHORITATIVE CHARACTERS]\nPortrayal fields guide NPC behavior only. Purpose is not a campaign goal. Morality/private notes/personality never grant Nicco or other NPCs knowledge; do not recite them as public facts.\nCharacter Nicco (nicco): {\"profile\":{\"name\":\"Nicco\",\"aliases\":[]},\"current\":{\"current_location\":\"heartstone_square\"},\"canonical_awareness\":[]}\nCharacter Korvin (korvin): {\"baseline\":{\"id\":\"korvin\",\"name\":\"Korvin\",\"display_name\":\"Korvin\",\"summary\":\"Korvin is a commercially reliable generalist licensed slaver in the private-seller area of Calderan Slave Market.\",\"secret\":false,\"appearance\":\"Short and compact, with a manual-labor appearance, large damaged hands, a hooked nose and small, mobile, perceptive eyes. Cheap practical clothing makes him look more like a warehouse worker or livestock trader than a major slaver.\",\"portrayal\":{\"purpose\":\"Accumulate wealth as personal independence: reach a point where nobody can command him again.\",\"morality\":\"Treats enslaved people as property and workforce and accepts coercion and violence. He is not sadistic. His personal limit is refusing to buy or sell children under twelve.\",\"personality\":[\"gruff\",\"pragmatic\",\"poorly mannered\",\"simple lower-class speech\",\"socially perceptive\",\"suspicious\",\"experienced at reading customers\",\"not sadistic\"],\"affiliations\":[],\"private_notes\":\"The loss of a daughter long ago is the private reason for his under-twelve limit. Do not volunteer this as public knowledge. He avoids the Back-Back Alleys. He does not personally know Dren by default. His private instinct about Bartolomhew has not been specified.\",\"authority\":\"narrator_portrayal_only_not_character_knowledge\"},\"content\":\"Korvin sells enslaved people through a licensed generalist operation in the private-seller area of Calderan Slave Market. His trade is practical and commercially reliable, oriented toward workforce needs rather than prestige. He also has commercial and storage activity associated with the Back Alleys. He does not buy or sell children under twelve. No exact building layout or residence is established.\",\"traits\":[\"gruff\",\"pragmatic\",\"poorly mannered\",\"simple lower-class speech\",\"socially perceptive\",\"suspicious\",\"experienced at reading customers\",\"not sadistic\"]},\"profile\":{\"name\":\"Korvin\",\"aliases\":[]},\"current\":{\"current_location\":\"heartstone_square\"},\"canonical_awareness\":[]}\n[CURRENT EQUIPMENT]\nVisible carried/equipped items (ownership and positions are authoritative): []\nScheduled events: []",
